---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for Anime Story Films.">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><em>Last updated: 19 November 2026.</em></p>
  <p>
    Anime Story Films is a small, original fiction blog. This policy
    explains, in plain words, what we collect and what we do not.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>
    We do not run user accounts, and we do not ask you to sign up to
    read our stories. If you email us, or use the mailing list sign-up
    in the footer, the only thing we receive is the email address and
    message you send us yourself — sent as an email to
    <a href="mailto:animestory2009@gmail.com">animestory2009@gmail.com</a>.
    We use it only to reply to you or to send you new-episode updates
    you asked for.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    We may use basic, privacy-friendly analytics to see which episodes
    are read most — page views and referrers only. We do not track you
    across other sites, and we do not build advertising profiles.
  </p>

  <h2>What we never do</h2>
  <p>
    We never sell, rent, or share your email address or any personal
    information with anyone. We never show third-party advertising
    trackers that follow you around the web.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choice</h2>
  <p>
    You can ask us at any time to stop emailing you or to delete your
    email address from our list — just write to
    <a href="mailto:animestory2009@gmail.com">animestory2009@gmail.com</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    If you have any question about this policy, contact us at
    <a href="mailto:animestory2009@gmail.com">animestory2009@gmail.com</a>
    or see our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.
  </p>
</Layout>
